      "_id": "6af3df0712fd78f09cb5040b",
      "title": "명품 브랜드들은 새로운 경험을 통해 젊은 소비자들을 유혹하려 노력한다.",
      "message": "<article class=\"nv-text\">\n<p class=\"nv-cover\"><img class=\"nv-cover-img\" src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/YugzvddGTOM/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"명품 브랜드들은 새로운 경험을 통해 젊은 소비자들을 유혹하려 노력한다.\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></p>\n<div class=\"nv-lead\">\n<p class=\"nv-lead-text\">명품 브랜드들은 새로운 경험을 통해 젊은 소비자들을 유혹하려 노력한다. 주제를 다룬 CNN 기사에서 주요 시사 영단어를 정리합니다. *AI 음성과 이미지를 사용했습니다.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"nv-body\">\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">...cleaned and <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">carved</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"...cleaned and carved small silver pieces under microscopes\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button> small silver pieces under microscopes</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">현미경 아래에서 작은 은 조각들을 닦고 조각했다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. carve: 조각하다, 깎아 만들다</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">...they peered through a magnifying glass at the glittering golden plume of a diamond bird.<button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"...they peered through a magnifying glass at the glittering golden plume of a diamond bird.\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button></p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">그들은 돋보기를 통해 다이아몬드 새의 반짝이는 황금 깃털 장식을 자세히 들여다봤다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. peer through: ~을 통해 자세히 들여다보다</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">Many <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">staffers</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"Many staffers had worked at Tiffany’s for decades.\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button> had worked at Tiffany’s for decades.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">많은 직원이 티파니에서 수십 년 동안 일해 왔다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. staffer: 직원, 스태프</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">Such <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">glimpses</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"Such glimpses into product innovation could revive customer trust for legacy brands.\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button> into product innovation could revive customer trust for legacy brands.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">제품 혁신 과정을 잠깐 엿보는 이러한 기회가 전통 브랜드에 대한 고객 신뢰를 되살릴 수 있다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. glimpse: 잠깐 봄, 엿보기</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">Luxury brands try to <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">entice</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"Luxury brands try to entice younger consumers with new experiences.\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button> younger consumers with new experiences.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">명품 브랜드들이 새로운 체험으로 젊은 소비자들을 끌어들이려 하고 있다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. entice: 유인하다, 꾀다</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">“Les Journées Particulières,” the <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">brainchild</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"“Les Journées Particulières,” the brainchild of Arnault, was created in 2011 to spotlight the company’s artisans.\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button> of Arnault, was created in 2011 to spotlight the company’s artisans.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">아르노의 구상에서 탄생한 '레 주르네 파르티퀼리에르'는 회사의 장인들을 조명하기 위해 2011년에 만들어졌다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. brainchild: 아이디어의 산물, 구상의 결과물</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n</div>\n<footer class=\"nv-related-links\">\n<p class=\"nv-related-link-line\"><a class=\"nv-related-link nv-related-link--youtube\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YugzvddGTOM\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">📺</span> 유튜브 보기</a></p>\n<div class=\"board-comments-root nv-related-comments\" data-board-comments-root></div>\n</footer>\n<footer class=\"nv-source\">\n  <p class=\"nv-source-label\">출처</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-text\">CNN | Luxury brands try to entice younger consumers with new experiences | By Auzinea Bacon , Nina Giraldo</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-link-wrap\"><a class=\"nv-source-link\" href=\"https://edition.cnn.com/2026/11/09/business/luxury-brands-exhibits-lvmh\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">원문 기사 보기</a></p>\n</footer>\n</article>",
